"Marsha is an S-rank weapon Meister in Alden Thorn's CNH class, condescending about B-ranks."
"She is curvy, with blue eyes and a dark ponytail."
"Her polearm has an engraved bone haft and a shape-changing blade; she can pull herself to it."
"She is the only student to beat Finlay in class, slicing him in half."
"She has rank tunnel vision, wants to fight only S-ranks, and runs herself dry."
"In the Matadero flood she pulled two Franklin High girls over the broken Span via her spear."
"Her class title is Meister of the Mutable Haft; in a duel she broke Alden's skill instantly."
